      "content": "It's a heavy weight to carry all of that, but what you're feeling is the natural response to a massive, crushing loss. Instead of letting shame define you, consider how much more pain you'll endure by staying in this cycle of self-blame. You don't have to face this wreckage alone; there are ways to find a solid ground beneath you, even if it's just a quiet, necessary break.",
